  "body": "Extend `assets/posts/brother-speedio.cps` with Brother CNC-C00/D00 high-accuracy smoothing, spindle air blow, and optional tool-breakage checks.\n\n## Scope\n- Wire `PARAM.Smoothing` and `PARAM.SmoothingMode` (`crates/app/src/smoothing.rs`) to Brother High-Accuracy `M298 L<n>` / `M299` (default) and optional Mode A (`M260`–`M267` / `M269`) or Mode B (`M280`–`M287` / `M289`) selection via post properties.\n- Emit smoothing off (`M298 L0` or `M269`/`M289` cancel) before touch-probe cycles so look-ahead does not distort trigger positions.\n- Support Brother spindle air blow / tool wash (`M498`/`M499`) and coolant blow (`M458`/`M459`) alongside flood (`M08`/`M09`) and through-spindle coolant (`M494`/`M495`).\n- Add opt-in post properties (off by default) for tool-breakage check calls (`M120`/`M121` touch sensor signal check and `M200`/`M201`/`M203` break-detect option).\n- Support machine `safe_retract` configuration (`G91 G28 Z0`, `G30`, or `G53 G0 Z0`).\n\nDone means: `brother-speedio.cps` emits and cancels Brother smoothing per operation mode, cancels smoothing on probe operations, supports all Brother air/coolant options and gated break-detect calls, and passes updated `crates/post/tests/brother_speedio_post.rs` and `script_brother_speedio.rs` goldens.\n\nPart of #1960\n",
